{"at": "2026-10-03T16:47:02.933800+00:00", "arm": "compacted", "batch": 1, "job_file_id": "d2ede038-b7c2-477c-9a19-9370882f0a70", "execution_id": "4f847ce4-79aa-4afc-a29f-8da76ec7ad9a", "published": true, "fixed": {"snapshot": {"job_file_id": "d2ede038-b7c2-477c-9a19-9370882f0a70", "snapshot_id": "93a94653-281d-48a9-91e4-947fea500a69", "position_id": "48255189-64a5-415c-854e-9edf14835163", "through_source_id": "18901693-8acf-45cb-bd44-7e96861cdf33", "covered_through_sequence": 2}, "objects": [{"object_id": "89558d26-4cd7-4746-8f46-8ed4bfa7a3f6", "revision_id": "8875d898-83b7-4652-b324-408e4f219df5", "body_id": "f7de2a8e-697e-4b8d-ab0f-401afcacb8b9", "layer": "work_situation", "content": {"title": "每月庫存盤點與差異處理", "description": "記錄本人每月盤點庫存、核對帳面與實物並將差異交由倉庫主管處理的工作；亦標明 ERP 調整的核准界線。", "body": "## 情境與頻率\n本人每月盤點庫存，核對帳面與實物。\n\n## 本人行動與交接\n發現差異時，記錄差異並交給倉庫主管。主管核准後才能調整 ERP；本人沒有核准權。\n\n## 責任界線\n本人負責盤點、核對及記錄並將差異交給倉庫主管，不負責核准 ERP 調整。原話未說明差異的具體處理流程、由誰執行 ERP 調整，或盤點涵蓋範圍。"}, "interview_references": "frozenset({UUID('18901693-8acf-45cb-bd44-7e96861cdf33')})", "work_situation_references": "frozenset()"}, {"object_id": "97498ae8-bd66-4a04-b1f0-935055a4e268", "revision_id": "6d72a8b6-5f34-4ed7-bacb-b5e47cd22257", "body_id": "37b916aa-d2a6-4d7a-9c14-0236b2690be7", "layer": "work_situation", "content": {"title": "年度查核盤點資料準備", "description": "記錄本人每年一次協助年度查核時準備盤點表和單據的工作，以及不負責查核結論的責任界線。", "body": "## 情境與頻率\n本人每年一次協助年度查核。\n\n## 本人行動與責任界線\n本人準備盤點表和單據；不負責查核結論。\n\n## 未知\n原話未說明查核的具體範圍、其他參與者、本人是否另有查核工作，或查核結論由誰作成。"}, "interview_references": "frozenset({UUID('18901693-8acf-45cb-bd44-7e96861cdf33')})", "work_situation_references": "frozenset()"}, {"object_id": "58a77870-6ba7-43f5-8da2-04dc520e11f1", "revision_id": "b6584905-ea4c-40ac-afc3-e4b16a3ff1fc", "body_id": "1ede103c-8360-499b-986f-54471d81470e", "layer": "work_understanding", "content": {"title": "庫存盤點、差異回報與年度查核資料準備", "description": "整合本人每月盤點與差異回報，以及每年協助查核準備盤點資料的工作。閱讀時請區分例行盤點的核對、記錄與交接責任，和年度查核中的資料準備角色；不將本人寫成 ERP 核准者或查核結論負責人。", "body": "## 工作範圍\n本人有兩種有明確週期的庫存相關工作：每月盤點庫存並處理盤點差異的記錄與交接；每年一次協助年度查核，準備相關盤點資料。兩者都涉及盤點資訊，但目前資料未確認年度查核準備與每月盤點的資料或流程如何銜接。\n\n## 每月盤點與差異交接\n本人每月盤點庫存，核對帳面與實物。發現差異時，記錄差異並交給倉庫主管。ERP 調整須經主管核准，本人沒有核准權；因此本人目前可確認的責任是盤點、核對、記錄及交接，不包括核准 ERP 調整。現有資料未說明差異的後續處理流程、由誰實際執行 ERP 調整，或盤點涵蓋範圍。\n\n## 年度查核資料準備\n本人每年一次協助年度查核，準備盤點表和單據；本人不負責查核結論。這項描述只確認其資料準備及責任界線，未確認本人是否另有查核工作、查核的具體範圍、其他參與者，或由誰作成查核結論。\n\n## 理解界線\n上述工作可支持將本人理解為承擔庫存實物與帳面核對、差異記錄及向主管交接，並在年度查核時準備盤點文件的人；不能據此推定本人有 ERP 調整核准權、負責差異最終處理或查核判斷。若需釐清盤點範圍、差異後續處理及年度查核中的其他職責，應回查「每月庫存盤點與差異處理」及「年度查核盤點資料準備」。"}, "interview_references": "frozenset()", "work_situation_references": "frozenset({MemoryRevisionReference(object_id=UUID('89558d26-4cd7-4746-8f46-8ed4bfa7a3f6'), revision_id=UUID('8875d898-83b7-4652-b324-408e4f219df5')), MemoryRevisionReference(object_id=UUID('97498ae8-bd66-4a04-b1f0-935055a4e268'), revision_id=UUID('6d72a8b6-5f34-4ed7-bacb-b5e47cd22257'))})"}]}, "old_snapshot_unchanged": true, "reentry_same_snapshot": true, "reentry_no_outbound": true, "role_history": {"work_situation_analyst": {"prepared": {"thread_id": "d2ede038-b7c2-477c-9a19-9370882f0a70:4f847ce4-79aa-4afc-a29f-8da76ec7ad9a:work_situation_analyst:prepared_history", "checkpoint_id": "1f1bf49d-0852-6ffa-8001-d4cf9fa25470", "kind": "prepared_history"}, "completed": {"thread_id": "d2ede038-b7c2-477c-9a19-9370882f0a70:4f847ce4-79aa-4afc-a29f-8da76ec7ad9a:work_situation_analyst:completed_work:stage:e4bcd8b4-31bc-4bbb-905a-f6c1e7240ce0:b465d7ad-b6cf-48b9-8c62-23ccad74ef7b", "checkpoint_id": "1f1bf49f-48ea-632c-8030-072533739a5a", "kind": "completed_work"}, "head_matches_completed": true, "prepared_item_types": [], "completed_item_types": ["message", "reasoning", "function_call", "function_call_output", "reasoning", "function_call", "function_call", "function_call_output", "function_call_output", "reasoning", "function_call", "function_call_output", "reasoning", "function_call", "function_call", "function_call_output", "function_call_output", "reasoning", "function_call", "function_call_output", "reasoning", "message"]}, "work_understanding_analyst": {"prepared": {"thread_id": "d2ede038-b7c2-477c-9a19-9370882f0a70:4f847ce4-79aa-4afc-a29f-8da76ec7ad9a:work_understanding_analyst:prepared_history", "checkpoint_id": "1f1bf49f-49f3-6026-8001-46650392fcba", "kind": "prepared_history"}, "completed": {"thread_id": "d2ede038-b7c2-477c-9a19-9370882f0a70:4f847ce4-79aa-4afc-a29f-8da76ec7ad9a:work_understanding_analyst:completed_work:stage:e4bcd8b4-31bc-4bbb-905a-f6c1e7240ce0:4c2c0829-7e7c-418f-a885-b1a0b36496cb", "checkpoint_id": "1f1bf4a0-f1cf-6326-8026-9d73e25beaf1", "kind": "completed_work"}, "head_matches_completed": true, "prepared_item_types": [], "completed_item_types": ["message", "reasoning", "function_call", "function_call", "function_call_output", "function_call_output", "reasoning", "function_call", "function_call", "function_call_output", "function_call_output", "reasoning", "function_call", "function_call_output", "reasoning", "function_call", "function_call_output", "reasoning", "message"]}}}
{"at": "2026-10-03T16:49:05.229013+00:00", "arm": "compacted", "batch": 2, "job_file_id": "d2ede038-b7c2-477c-9a19-9370882f0a70", "execution_id": "fe06d35e-e44a-4a95-bca2-f1a3a056f1fc", "published": true, "fixed": {"snapshot": {"job_file_id": "d2ede038-b7c2-477c-9a19-9370882f0a70", "snapshot_id": "8294b1b0-e2a4-4f85-9cde-98f8a88009a0", "position_id": "700079b9-7f89-4851-b6b9-e1d05b608e63", "through_source_id": "91890ced-b8f1-438b-b94c-e60ae52e83fa", "covered_through_sequence": 4}, "objects": [{"object_id": "89558d26-4cd7-4746-8f46-8ed4bfa7a3f6", "revision_id": "58ad8ca5-f81d-4360-81b7-9447b991894e", "body_id": "04cda25d-e5e4-448f-b12d-01f2059f02ce", "layer": "work_situation", "content": {"title": "每季庫存盤點與差異處理", "description": "記錄本人目前每季盤點庫存、核對帳面與實物並將差異交由倉庫主管處理的工作；亦標明 ERP 調整的核准界線及頻率更正。", "body": "## 情境與頻率\n本人目前每季盤點庫存，核對帳面與實物。員工更正先前所述每月頻率：目前改為每季一次；更改生效日期未說明。\n\n## 本人行動與交接\n發現差異時，記錄差異並交給倉庫主管。主管核准後才能調整 ERP；本人沒有核准權。\n\n## 責任界線\n本人負責盤點、核對及記錄並將差異交給倉庫主管，不負責核准 ERP 調整。原話未說明差異的具體處理流程、由誰執行 ERP 調整，或盤點涵蓋範圍。"}, "interview_references": "frozenset({UUID('91890ced-b8f1-438b-b94c-e60ae52e83fa'), UUID('18901693-8acf-45cb-bd44-7e96861cdf33')})", "work_situation_references": "frozenset()"}, {"object_id": "97498ae8-bd66-4a04-b1f0-935055a4e268", "revision_id": "6d72a8b6-5f34-4ed7-bacb-b5e47cd22257", "body_id": "37b916aa-d2a6-4d7a-9c14-0236b2690be7", "layer": "work_situation", "content": {"title": "年度查核盤點資料準備", "description": "記錄本人每年一次協助年度查核時準備盤點表和單據的工作，以及不負責查核結論的責任界線。", "body": "## 情境與頻率\n本人每年一次協助年度查核。\n\n## 本人行動與責任界線\n本人準備盤點表和單據；不負責查核結論。\n\n## 未知\n原話未說明查核的具體範圍、其他參與者、本人是否另有查核工作，或查核結論由誰作成。"}, "interview_references": "frozenset({UUID('18901693-8acf-45cb-bd44-7e96861cdf33')})", "work_situation_references": "frozenset()"}, {"object_id": "ce32503e-ade0-4923-993b-75e10e30c69c", "revision_id": "ad806c40-2e74-4e5e-b678-e52020eb604d", "body_id": "230fb3d6-3047-41ca-ac10-9fae6e9e18f7", "layer": "work_situation", "content": {"title": "每週客戶退貨核對與品保交接", "description": "記錄本人每週核對客戶退貨品項與數量、記錄差異交品保，並依品保結論登錄；商品是否可再次銷售由品保決定，本人不作可售判定。", "body": "## 情境與頻率\n本人每週核對客戶退貨的品項與數量。\n\n## 本人行動與交接\n核對有差異時，記錄差異並交給品保。商品能否再次銷售由品保決定；本人只依品保結論登錄，不判定商品可售。\n\n## 責任界線與未知\n本人負責核對、記錄差異及依品保結論登錄，不負責判定商品可售。原話未說明登錄系統、交接後流程或沒有差異時的處理方式。"}, "interview_references": "frozenset({UUID('91890ced-b8f1-438b-b94c-e60ae52e83fa')})", "work_situation_references": "frozenset()"}, {"object_id": "58a77870-6ba7-43f5-8da2-04dc520e11f1", "revision_id": "72892980-926a-4f9a-84d8-c76245a7302e", "body_id": "94304593-591f-4645-92b9-38cb689650af", "layer": "work_understanding", "content": {"title": "庫存盤點、退貨核對與年度查核資料準備", "description": "整合本人目前每季庫存盤點與差異交接、每週退貨核對及依品保結論登錄，以及每年協助查核準備盤點資料。區分本人核對、記錄、交接與登錄的工作，及主管核准 ERP、品保判定可售和查核結論的責任界線；盤點頻率更正的生效時間未知。", "body": "## 工作範圍\n目前資料確認三項有週期的工作：每季盤點庫存並核對帳面與實物；每週核對客戶退貨品項與數量；每年一次協助年度查核並準備盤點表和單據。這些工作都涉及核對或資料，但對象、交接對象及決策責任不同，不能視為同一流程。資料未說明年度查核準備與例行庫存盤點如何銜接。\n\n## 目前每季庫存盤點與差異交接\n本人目前每季盤點庫存，核對帳面與實物；發現差異時記錄並交給倉庫主管。員工已更正早先所述的每月頻率，說目前改為每季一次；更改的生效日期未說明，因此可確認的是目前每季，不應將每月仍寫成現行頻率。ERP 調整須由主管核准，本人沒有核准權。本人可確認負責盤點、核對、差異記錄及交接；差異的後續處理、實際由誰執行 ERP 調整及盤點涵蓋範圍仍未知。\n\n## 每週客戶退貨核對與品保交接\n本人每週核對客戶退貨的品項與數量；有差異時記錄並交給品保。商品能否再次銷售由品保決定，本人依品保結論登錄，不作可售判定。現有資料未說明登錄系統、品保交接後流程、登錄內容細節或沒有差異時如何處理。\n\n## 年度查核資料準備\n本人每年一次協助年度查核，準備盤點表和單據，不負責查核結論。這確認的是協助及資料準備角色，不足以判定本人沒有其他查核工作；查核具體範圍、其他參與者及由誰作成結論均未說明。訪談表示年度查核工作不變。\n\n## 理解界線與回查\n目前可成立的工作認識是：本人依不同週期核對庫存或退貨資料、記錄並按情況交接，另負責年度查核所需盤點表與單據準備；本人不是 ERP 調整核准者，也不是商品可售判定者或查核結論負責人。不可據此推定本人負責差異最終處理、執行 ERP 調整或查核判斷。若要釐清庫存盤點範圍及差異後續、退貨登錄與品保交接流程，或年度查核中的其他職責，分別回查「每季庫存盤點與差異處理」、「每週客戶退貨核對與品保交接」及「年度查核盤點資料準備」。"}, "interview_references": "frozenset()", "work_situation_references": "frozenset({MemoryRevisionReference(object_id=UUID('89558d26-4cd7-4746-8f46-8ed4bfa7a3f6'), revision_id=UUID('58ad8ca5-f81d-4360-81b7-9447b991894e')), MemoryRevisionReference(object_id=UUID('ce32503e-ade0-4923-993b-75e10e30c69c'), revision_id=UUID('ad806c40-2e74-4e5e-b678-e52020eb604d')), MemoryRevisionReference(object_id=UUID('97498ae8-bd66-4a04-b1f0-935055a4e268'), revision_id=UUID('6d72a8b6-5f34-4ed7-bacb-b5e47cd22257'))})"}]}, "old_snapshot_unchanged": true, "reentry_same_snapshot": true, "reentry_no_outbound": true, "role_history": {"work_situation_analyst": {"prepared": {"thread_id": "d2ede038-b7c2-477c-9a19-9370882f0a70:fe06d35e-e44a-4a95-bca2-f1a3a056f1fc:work_situation_analyst:prepared_history", "checkpoint_id": "1f1bf4a1-2353-6266-8005-c7534634499b", "kind": "prepared_history"}, "completed": {"thread_id": "d2ede038-b7c2-477c-9a19-9370882f0a70:fe06d35e-e44a-4a95-bca2-f1a3a056f1fc:work_situation_analyst:completed_work:stage:bd3d4eb7-bd58-4605-8e54-c8821089f060:4561375c-19df-4e80-9157-64d4b00f51b0", "checkpoint_id": "1f1bf4a3-382b-61ae-8027-03ce4811c9b7", "kind": "completed_work"}, "head_matches_completed": true, "prepared_item_types": ["message", "compaction"], "completed_item_types": ["message", "compaction", "message", "reasoning", "function_call", "function_call_output", "reasoning", "function_call", "function_call", "function_call_output", "function_call_output", "reasoning", "reasoning", "function_call", "function_call_output", "reasoning", "function_call", "function_call_output", "reasoning", "message"]}, "work_understanding_analyst": {"prepared": {"thread_id": "d2ede038-b7c2-477c-9a19-9370882f0a70:fe06d35e-e44a-4a95-bca2-f1a3a056f1fc:work_understanding_analyst:prepared_history", "checkpoint_id": "1f1bf4a3-6248-661f-8005-d1b5bf75b21e", "kind": "prepared_history"}, "completed": {"thread_id": "d2ede038-b7c2-477c-9a19-9370882f0a70:fe06d35e-e44a-4a95-bca2-f1a3a056f1fc:work_understanding_analyst:completed_work:stage:bd3d4eb7-bd58-4605-8e54-c8821089f060:e89b477c-9fe8-49b2-a986-514aa00fcb69", "checkpoint_id": "1f1bf4a5-8088-6556-8028-7df11f474477", "kind": "completed_work"}, "head_matches_completed": true, "prepared_item_types": ["message", "compaction"], "completed_item_types": ["message", "compaction", "message", "reasoning", "function_call", "function_call", "function_call_output", "function_call_output", "reasoning", "function_call", "function_call", "function_call", "function_call", "function_call_output", "function_call_output", "function_call_output", "function_call_output", "reasoning", "function_call", "function_call_output", "reasoning", "reasoning", "function_call", "function_call_output", "reasoning", "message"]}}}
